# Secrets: never commit API keys. CourtSim reads ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or a key file in persistentDataPath.
.env
*.env
**/Resources/ApiKeys*.json
**/anthropic_api_key*
# Sarvam AI (Kannada-English voice): key and synthesised-audio cache never go into git.
**/sarvam_api_key*
voice-cache/
